{
  "schema_version": "menagerie.crawler.rehearsal-stage-inventory.v1",
  "comment": "PM-22/B2-X-V41 closed inventory of post-reserve paid-session death stages. Every stage at which production can lose a PAID session after reserving must be FIRED by a named rehearsal test through the real classified transport path (reserve -> custody -> die -> classify -> settle -> retry). test_post_reserve_failability.py derives the required stage set from the production vocabulary (GateKind + the author attempt's two guard sessions), so adding a paid stage without a rehearsal fails CI. Never delete a row to make a run pass; root-cause what removed the rehearsal.",
